# Development tooling accepts exported variables; this file is documentation,
# not automatically loaded and not part of the deployment ZIP.
# Use the SAME absolute private directory for PHP hosting and the setup CLI.
# ETEHADYAR_PRIVATE_DIR=/home/ACCOUNT/.etehadyar-private
# PORT=8080
# ETEHADYAR_TRUST_PROXY=0
# Optional first-account bootstrap through private host configuration ONLY:
# ETEHADYAR_ADMIN_USERNAME=YOUR_USERNAME
# ETEHADYAR_ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH=YOUR_VALID_PASSWORD_HASH
# Never put a plaintext password or a production credential in this example.
